📖 Program 8 — Read and Parse Student Records

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to read student records from a text file and separate individual fields such as roll number, name, and marks.

It uses "stringstream" to parse each line according to the delimiter used when storing the records.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 📖 Reading records from a file
- 🧩 Parsing structured text
- 🔢 Extracting individual fields
- 🧵 Using "stringstream"
- 🎓 Processing student data

📁 File Used

"students.txt"

🧠 Main C++ Feature

"std::stringstream"
